{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Story mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120 levels to unlock and progress. Follow the story of Sophie who is taking over her grandmother Celeste's cheese shop after her unexpected death. Watch  Cheese Party come back to life, meet the locals of a seaside town as you progress through the levels. If story isn't for you use the skip button to get to the cheese.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzle mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish  puzzles  leaving no cheese  on the board to win.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920060/extras/653806e9d82d644492389756fbd60a5a.poster.avif?t=1763615606\" aria-label=\"Cheese being moved to match one by one.\" width=436 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920060/extras/653806e9d82d644492389756fbd60a5a.webm?t=1763615606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920060/extras/653806e9d82d644492389756fbd60a5a.mp4?t=1763615606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on fun levels without interruption. Complete the level to move on to the next and loop endlessly.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920060/extras/91e69b2bacff48f30cdb6b42f78cada8.poster.avif?t=1763615606\" aria-label=\"Level after level of cheese matching.\" width=438 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920060/extras/91e69b2bacff48f30cdb6b42f78cada8.webm?t=1763615606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920060/extras/91e69b2bacff48f30cdb6b42f78cada8.mp4?t=1763615606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam workshop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and upload your own Cheese party levels and story and share with the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Power ups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move cheese; diagonally, skip cheese, move cheese. Power ups are rewarded randomly for 3 star scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casual play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax. No pay to win or micro transactions.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Raincode is a game dev family made up of self taught artists and  developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920060/extras/0e2f7b48a8e6bba19cb8daf7869b9e15.poster.avif?t=1763615606\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=620 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920060/extras/0e2f7b48a8e6bba19cb8daf7869b9e15.webm?t=1763615606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"3 Stars award ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2920060/d8923f7f58e1c40c03e8d5519d2e304571ab4596.jpg"},{"name":"Skip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2920060/f4a80d1ee097562a3470e5ff335ac26872147cdf.jpg"},{"name":"100 Cheese orders","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2920060/3ea445f4ff66f52171079ce666698d2e68e07911.jpg"},{"name":"Brie party","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2920060/1638bf4814c8a5d97b0e387c7949f2bf0605b91a.jpg"},{"name":"Cheese tool","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2920060/0f88a8e31ac791969958bfa3d178d32b2556e272.jpg"},{"name":"Stinky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co